    <description>System-check-led field quote for Brightline residential HVAC. The comfort advisor checks each piece of equipment, logging findings with data plates, readings, notes and photos; rules turn findings into a recommended comfort agreement, add-ons, repairs and the equipment age band. The quote screen is pre-filled with the recommendation and its reasons, requires a reason for any override, and Apex creates a priced Quote (agreement per system, Initial Tune-up, repairs) linked to the system check.</description>
